  "site_name": "",
  "description": "This Design and Access Statement supports a Prior Approval Application for a large single-storey rear extension to the residential property at 27 Hartington Road, London E16 3NP. The proposal is made under the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) and seeks to confirm that the extension meets the requirements for permitted development.\n\nThe scheme proposes a rear extension projecting 4m from the original rear wall and spanning the full 6084mm width of the property, remaining entirely within the site boundaries. The extension is designed to provide an improved open-plan living and dining space, enhancing the functionality and amenity of the home.\n\nThe external envelope will comprise blockwork cavity walls finished in white K-rend render, with aluminium-framed, double-glazed folding doors opening onto the rear garden. A fibreglass flat roof incorporating a centrally positioned triple-glazed roof light will provide natural light deep into the new space.\n\nPrior to submission, the applicant engaged with adjoining neighbours, who have confirmed their support for the proposal. The design is proportionate to the host property, sympathetic to the character of the surrounding area, and will have no adverse impact on neighbouring amenity or access.",
